[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10746.55, "timestamp": "02:59:06", "text": "稱它為魔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10748.15, "timestamp": "02:59:08", "text": "像，對吧？是的。  而且它的眼睛是紅色的。為什麼？  魔像。  是什麼改變了區塊？等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10755.59, "timestamp": "02:59:15", "text": "什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10772.87, "timestamp": "02:59:32", "text": "買到衛生紙了嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10777.51, "timestamp": "02:59:37", "text": "不，她正在想著如何佈置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10783.349, "timestamp": "02:59:43", "text": "魔法桌。哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10793.19, "timestamp": "02:59:53", "text": "嘿，我說的是紫水晶塊。"}]